{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2020-03-09 11:30:00', 'title': 'Twitter, Inc. Announces Partnership With Silver Lake And Elliott Management', 'text': 'TWITTER, INC. ANNOUNCES PARTNERSHIP WITH SILVER LAKE AND ELLIOTT MANAGEMENT.TWITTER INC - BOARD AUTHORIZES $2 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM, ENTERS INTO COOPERATION AGREEMENT WITH ELLIOTT MANAGEMENT.TWITTER INC - SILVER LAKE TO MAKE $1 BILLION INVESTMENT.TWITTER INC - EXPECTS TO USE SILVER LAKE\'S INVESTMENT, TOGETHER WITH CASH ON HAND, TO FUND A $2 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM THAT WILL BE EXECUTED OVER TIME.TWITTER - EGON DURBAN, CO-CEO AND MANAGING PARTNER OF SILVER LAKE, AND JESSE COHN, PARTNER AT ELLIOTT, WILL BE APPOINTED TO TWITTER BOARD OF DIRECTORS.TWITTER INC - BOARD WILL CONTINUE PROCESS OF IDENTIFYING A THIRD NEW INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR.TWITTER INC - AMBITION IN 2020 AND BEYOND IS TO GROW MDAU AT 20% OR MORE.TWITTER INC - BOARD HAS FORMED INDEPENDENT FIVE-PERSON COMMITTEE THAT WILL BUILD ON BOARD\'S REGULAR EVALUATION OF TWITTER\'S LEADERSHIP STRUCTURE.TWITTER INC - ELLIOTT AND SILVER LAKE FURTHER COMMIT TO "MAINTAINING INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY OF TWITTER PLATFORM AND ITS RULES AND ENFORCEMENT".TWITTER INC - SILVER LAKE AGREED TO PURCHASE $1 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF COMPANY\'S 0.375% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2025.TWITTER INC -  INDEPENDENT COMMITTEE WILL ALSO EVALUATE CEO SUCCESSION PLAN WITH CEO.TWITTER - ELLIOTT, SILVER LAKE WILL NOT COMMENT ON/INFLUENCE/ATTEMPT TO INFLUENCE, DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY ANY TWITTER POLICIES/RULES/ ENFORCEMENT DECISIONS.'}
